<body>
<header class="site-header"></header>
<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap page-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">YZH Dental Lab Services</p>
        <h1>Focused support for implant, full-arch and digital restorative cases.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Choose the service that matches your case, then send one trial case for technical review. We confirm the records, implant details and production requirements before moving forward.</p>
        <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/submit-case">Submit a Case</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/cases">View Our Cases</a></div>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/real/hero-full-arch-premium-01.jpg" alt="Full-arch implant restoration work from YZH Dental Lab" width="1600" height="900" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core Capabilities</p>
        <h2>Services designed around real case submission.</h2>
        <p class="copy">Each service page explains what we support, what records to send and how the technical review process works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-grid architecture-service-grid">
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/services/implant"><h3>Implant Restorations</h3><p>Custom abutments, Ti-base, screw-retained restorations and implant bridge workflows.</p><span class="text-link">View Implant support</span></a>
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/services/full-arch"><h3>Full-Arch / All-on-X</h3><p>PMMA provisional, final zirconia, titanium bar and full-arch technical review.</p><span class="text-link">View Full-Arch support</span></a>
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/services/crown-bridge"><h3>Crown & Bridge</h3><p>Zirconia, PFM, veneers, inlays, onlays and overflow restorative support.</p><span class="text-link">View Crown & Bridge</span></a>
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/services/digital-workflow"><h3>CAD/CAM Design</h3><p>Exocad design, file review, approval communication and design-plus-manufacturing workflows.</p><span class="text-link">View Digital Workflow</span></a>
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/services/surgical-guide"><h3>Surgical Guides</h3><p>Design-only and printed guide support when complete clinical records are provided.</p><span class="text-link">View Surgical Guides</span></a>
        <a class="service-card text-panel" href="/submit-case"><h3>Trial Case Review</h3><p>Send one case first so both teams can confirm communication, files and production expectations.</p><span class="text-link">Send a Trial Case</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How To Start</p>
        <h2>Send the records you already have.</h2>
        <p class="copy">The fastest first case includes the prescription, STL or PLY files, photos if needed, implant system information and due date. If something important is missing, we ask before design or production.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-list">
        <article><h3>1. Submit a case</h3><p>Use the secure form or WhatsApp for initial communication.</p></article>
        <article><h3>2. Technical review</h3><p>Records, implant details, material path and risks are checked.</p></article>
        <article><h3>3. Confirm scope</h3><p>We clarify design-only or design-plus-manufacturing needs.</p></article>
        <article><h3>4. Start production</h3><p>Work begins when the required information is clear.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section trial">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Start With One Trial Case</p><h2>Let one real case prove the workflow.</h2><p class="copy">Send one implant, full-arch, CAD/CAM, crown and bridge or surgical guide case for review.</p></div>
      <div class="cta-panel"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/submit-case">Submit a Case</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/cases">View Our Cases</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
